## 5. Later stages

These are prepared but should be run only after checking the previous output.

```bash
# Train SRN/EM after RM fine-tuning.
bash scripts/20_train_srn_em.sh

# Train SIN with the configured SIN yaml.
bash scripts/30_train_sin.sh
```

If you want to use a different RM checkpoint for EM:

```bash
export SRN_RM_CHECKPOINT=/path/to/rm_checkpoint.pth
bash scripts/20_train_srn_em.sh
```

If you want to resume SIN:

```bash
export SIN_RESUME_CHECKPOINT=/path/to/sin_checkpoint.pth
bash scripts/30_train_sin.sh
```
